# package-lock.json is COMMITTED on purpose (2026-10-16): CI installs with npm and a
# floating tree let npm 10 crash on a transitive peer set ("Cannot read properties of
# null (reading 'edgesOut')"). Lovable builds with bun.lock; this lock pins the gate.

